labelled: 2026-09-17
--- code
async function readsSettlementScheme(house: string, entryType: string): Promise<boolean> {
  const claim = await askClearing({
    house,
    entryType,
    settlementScheme: NONEXISTENT_SETTLEMENT_SCHEME,
  });

  return claim === LedgerClaim.Unsupported;
}
--- facts
Checks whether the ledger reads the settlement scheme field, by asking about a scheme no ledger supports. A ledger
that reads the field says no, and one too old to know it accepts anyway; much of a branch estate is that old, and
there a yes for one scheme is only a yes for the clearing house.
